Model checkpoints

The Laya.Model.* packages embed the configuration and tokenizer files of the Laya
decision checkpoints published at https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
(Apache-2.0). The weights themselves (model.safetensors) are not part of any
package; they are downloaded on first use from https://models.curiosity.ai/laya/
and remain subject to that same licence.

The checkpoints are trained on top of these base encoders:

  * answerdotai/ModernBERT-large — Apache-2.0
    https://huggingface.co/answerdotai/ModernBERT-large
  * jhu-clsp/mmBERT-base — MIT
    https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-base
